{'symbol': 'CERN', 'date': '2022-04-11 16:51:00', 'title': 'EXPIRATION DATE OF TENDER OFFER FOR CERNER CORPORATION SHARES EXTENDED TO MAY 11, 2022', 'text': 'AUSTIN, TEXAS , APRIL 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ORACLE CORPORATION (NYSE: ORCL) ("ORACLE") ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS EXTENDED ITS TENDER OFFER IN CONNECTION WITH THE ACQUISITION OF CERNER CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CERN) ("CERNER") UNTIL MAY 11, 2022. IN ACCORDANCE WITH THE TERMS OF ITS MERGER AGREEMENT WITH CERNER, CEDAR ACQUISITION CORPORATION, A SUBSIDIARY OF OC ACQUISITION LLC, WHICH IS A SUBSIDIARY OF ORACLE, HAS EXTENDED\xa0THE\xa0ALL-CASH\xa0TENDER\xa0OFFER FOR $95.00 PER SHARE FOR ALL OF THE ISSUED AND OUTSTANDING SHARES OF COMMON STOCK OF CERNER (THE "SHARES") TO 12:00 MIDNIGHT, EASTERN TIME, AT THE END OF THE DAY ON MAY 11, 2022.'}